
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>About Us | PRS Gaming</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Discover the story of PRS Gaming — Power Rage Success. Founded in 2013, built through competition, and back in 2026. #PRSTAKEOVER">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#090909">

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #090909;
      --panel: #121212;
      --red: #e50920;
      --red-dark: #a90718;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --muted: #a5a5a5;
      --border: #292929;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--white);
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .navbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 20px 8%;
      background: rgba(9, 9, 9, 0.95);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: var(--red);
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 24px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--red);
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 590px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 100px 8%;
      text-align: center;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #321016 0%, #16090b 35%, #090909 75%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 900px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--red);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      margin: 20px 0 8px;
      font-size: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 8rem);
      font-weight: 1000;
      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: -4px;
    }

    .hero h1 span {
      color: var(--red);
    }

    .hero h2 {
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.6rem);
      letter-spacing: 5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 24px auto 32px;
      color: #c5c5c5;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      background: var(--red);
      color: white;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background: var(--red-dark);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .button-outline {
      margin-left: 10px;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid #555;
    }

    .button-outline:hover {
      background: #202020;
    }

    .section {
      max-width: 1150px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 90px 28px;
    }

    .section-heading {
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .section-heading .eyebrow {
      letter-spacing: 3px;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.3rem);
      line-height: 1.15;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .section-heading h2 span {
      color: var(--red);
    }

    .intro {
      max-width: 850px;
      color: #c4c4c4;
      font-size: 1.08rem;
    }

    .intro strong {
      color: white;
    }

    .stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: #0e0e0e;
    }

    .stat {
      padding: 35px 15px;
      text-align: center;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .stat:last-child {
      border-right: none;
    }

    .stat h3 {
      color: var(--red);
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .stat p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .timeline {
      position: relative;
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding-left: 32px;
      border-left: 2px solid #3b171c;
    }

    .timeline-item {
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 38px;
      padding: 28px;
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .timeline-item::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 32px;
      left: -40px;
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
      background: var(--red);
      border: 3px solid var(--bg);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .year {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: var(--red);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .timeline-item h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .timeline-item p {
      color: #b9b9b9;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
      margin-top: 35px;
    }

    .card {
      padding: 30px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #171717, #0d0d0d);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-top: 3px solid var(--red);
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #b9b9b9;
    }

    .relaunch {
      padding: 100px 25px;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #25090d, #0c0c0c 65%);
      border-top: 1px solid #44151c;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #44151c;
    }

    .relaunch h2 {
      margin: 15px 0;
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem);
      font-weight: 1000;
      line-height: 1.1;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .relaunch h2 span {
      color: var(--red);
    }

    .relaunch p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      color: #c4c4c4;
    }

    .slogan {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
    }

    .slogan span {
      color: var(--red);
    }

    footer {
      padding: 35px 20px;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    footer strong {
      color: white;
    }

    footer .hashtag {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 8px;
      color: var(--red);
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .navbar {
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 18px;
      }

      .nav-links {
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 14px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 500px;
        padding: 75px 20px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        letter-spacing: -2px;
      }

      .hero h2 {
        letter-spacing: 2px;
      }

      .button {
        margin: 5px;
      }

      .stats {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .stat {
        border-right: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      .stat:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
      }

      .section {
        padding: 65px 20px;
      }

      .timeline {
        padding-left: 23px;
      }

      .timeline-item {
        padding: 22px;
      }

      .timeline-item::before {
        left: -31px;
      }

      .cards {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header class="navbar">
    <a href="#home" class="logo">PRS<span>.</span> GAMING</a>

    <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#story">Our Story</a>
      <a href="#legacy">Our Legacy</a>
      <a href="#relaunch">2026 Relaunch</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="eyebrow">Est. 2013 · Long Island, New York</div>

        <h1>PRS<span>.</span></h1>

        <h2>Power Rage Success</h2>

        <p>
          Built on friendship. Forged through competition.
          Driven by a legacy that refuses to fade.
          More than a decade in the making — PRS Gaming is back.
        </p>

        <a href="#story" class="button">Discover Our Story</a>
        <a href="#relaunch" class="button button-outline">The Takeover</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="about">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div class="eyebrow">Who We Are</div>
        <h2>More Than a Team.<br><span>A Legacy.</span></h2>
      </div>

      <p class="intro">
        <strong>PRS Gaming (Power Rage Success)</strong> is an American
        esports organization founded in 2013 in Long Island, New York.
        What started as a sniper-only, quickscoping Call of Duty team
        evolved into a worldwide amateur competitive organization,
        representing North America and Europe and competing across
        multiple eras of the Call of Duty scene.

        <br><br>

        From the early days of sniping to online tournaments,
        international rosters, and championship runs, PRS has always
        been about competition, brotherhood, and the drive to succeed.
        In 2026, a new chapter begins.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="stats" aria-label="PRS Gaming highlights">
      <div class="stat">
        <h3>2013</h3>
        <p>Year Founded</p>
      </div>

      <div class="stat">
        <h3>NA + EU</h3>
        <p>International Competition</p>
      </div>

      <div class="stat">
        <h3>2026</h3>
        <p>The Relaunch</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="story">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div class="eyebrow">The Journey</div>
        <h2>Our <span>Story</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline">

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="year">2013 · THE BEGINNING</div>
          <h3>Three Friends. One Vision.</h3>
          <p>
            PRS began as Precision Gaming, founded in Long Island,
            New York, by three real-life best friends: Blade, DUB11N,
            and Kamz. United by their passion for gaming and YouTube,
            they set out to build something of their own. When other
            clans began using the Precision Gaming name, they kept
            the initials and gave them a new meaning:
            <strong>Power Rage Success.</strong>
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="year">THE EARLY YEARS</div>
          <h3>Built on the Sniper Scene</h3>
          <p>
            PRS made its name as a strictly sniper-only, quickscoping
            Call of Duty team. The style helped establish the team's
            identity and build its reputation across the East Coast.
            PRS became known through its NJROD connections and the
            tournaments it competed in.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="year">2015 · A NEW CHAPTER</div>
          <h3>The Roster Evolves</h3>
          <p>
            As the original lineup changed, Night Stalker joined
            Blade in 2015, marking another chapter in the organization's
            development and setting the stage for its evolution beyond
            the original sniping scene.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="year">COMPETITIVE GROWTH</div>
          <h3>From Sniping to Championships</h3>
          <p>
            PRS expanded into online Call of Duty tournaments,
            building a competitive presence through AGN, the NAL,
            and Call of Duty Challengers competition. The organization
            recorded numerous tournament victories, including three
            consecutive AGN championships. In 2023, PRS acquired the
            NAL following the league's business closure.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="year">THE INTERNATIONAL ERA</div>
          <h3>A Worldwide Organization</h3>
          <p>
            At its peak, PRS fielded North American and European
            rosters, bringing together players from Spain, Germany,
            Mexico, England, Russia, Canada, and beyond. The team
            competed in the broader Call of Duty competitive ecosystem
            alongside established organizations such as FaZe, OpTic,
            and G2.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="year">2022–2025 · THE LEGACY</div>
          <h3>Players Who Moved Forward</h3>
          <p>
            PRS was part of the journeys of players who continued
            building their competitive careers. RenKoR represented
            PRS Gaming EU in 2023 before earning CDL 2025 Rookie
            of the Year honors. Lunarz played on PRS's North American
            roster during 2022–2023.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="legacy">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div class="eyebrow">What We Stand For</div>
        <h2>The PRS <span>Legacy</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Power</h3>
          <p>
            The ambition to build, compete, and push beyond expectations.
            Every era of PRS starts with the belief that there is always
            another level to reach.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Rage</h3>
          <p>
            The competitive fire that started with quickscoping and
            carried into tournament play. The hunger to compete is
            part of our identity.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Success</h3>
          <p>
            The result of commitment, teamwork, and persistence.
            From championship runs to international rosters, success
            has always been the goal.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Brotherhood</h3>
          <p>
            PRS was built by friends who shared a vision. That foundation
            remains at the heart of the organization as we begin our
            next chapter.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="intro" style="margin-top: 35px;">
        The organization also reached audiences beyond esports.
        UFC champion Cris Cyborg publicly interacted with PRS-related
        social media content, while former member PRS PRIME received
        VIP access to a Milwaukee Brewers game through his association
        with the team.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="relaunch" id="relaunch">
      <div class="eyebrow">The Next Chapter Starts Now</div>

      <h2>We're <span>Back.</span></h2>

      <p>
        More than a decade of history. Countless memories.
        A legacy built through competition.

        <br><br>

        In 2026, PRS Gaming returns for a new chapter.
        We're ready to see where this journey takes us.
        The mission continues, the name lives on, and the next
        era is ours to create.
      </p>

      <a href="#home" class="button">Welcome to the Takeover</a>

      <div class="slogan">
        POWER <span>|</span> RAGE <span>|</span> SUCCESS
      </div>

      <div class="slogan" style="color: var(--red);">
        #PRSTAKEOVER
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <strong>PRS GAMING</strong> · POWER RAGE SUCCESS
    <span class="hashtag">#PRSTAKEOVER</span>
    <p style="margin-top: 15px;">
      © 2026 PRS Gaming. All rights reserved.
    </p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
